WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:02.206
Hi, I'm Reeve!

00:00:02.206 --> 00:00:05.869
Today: why deleting every token with an e leaves a model babbling,

00:00:05.869 --> 00:00:08.922
and how training teaches it to write around the gap.

00:00:10.558 --> 00:00:13.537
A mask removes the letter, but not the plan that needed it.

00:00:13.537 --> 00:00:16.764
The model has to learn to plan words that never need an e.

00:00:20.758 --> 00:00:24.654
The model reads the prompt and scores every token in its vocabulary.

00:00:25.074 --> 00:00:29.756
The mask sets the score of every token containing an e to minus infinity.

00:00:29.756 --> 00:00:32.097
Nearly a third of the vocabulary goes.

00:00:32.517 --> 00:00:34.353
The sampler picks from what is left.

00:00:34.353 --> 00:00:36.976
That can be a word piece the model never planned.

00:00:37.396 --> 00:00:40.897
The piece joins the text, and the next step has to continue from it.

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:45.118
With only the mask, no answer has an e.

00:00:45.118 --> 00:00:48.909
But the model still plans words that need one, and the mask

00:00:48.909 --> 00:00:52.068
breaks them mid way, so you get riddiculous, riddiculous, riddiculous.

00:00:52.488 --> 00:00:55.650
After training under the mask, the model picks words that never need

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:57.231
an e in the first place.

00:00:58.942 --> 00:00:59.870
Five stations.

00:01:00.975 --> 00:01:02.360
Pick four prompts from the pool.

00:01:03.462 --> 00:01:06.079
Sample eight answers for each, with the mask on.

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:09.963
A judge scores every answer for sense and for answering the prompt.

00:01:10.383 --> 00:01:14.607
Subtract the group average, so only answers that beat their siblings are pushed up.

00:01:15.027 --> 00:01:16.804
Update a small adapter, and repeat.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:22.162
The writeup reports twenty-six percent usable with the mask alone.

00:01:22.162 --> 00:01:26.796
Training from examples first, then reinforcement learning, reaches sixty and a half.

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:32.625
The thing to remember: the mask handles the letter, and training handles the writing.

00:01:33.942 --> 00:01:38.038
The letter lives inside tokens, a mask bans tokens but not plans,

00:01:38.038 --> 00:01:39.744
and training teaches the plan.

00:01:40.164 --> 00:01:42.204
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:42.204 --> 00:01:42.786
I'm Reeve.

00:01:42.786 --> 00:01:43.078
Bye!
